bCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"Food","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"Zt7SfTU6N9SKDvVvpNpoGg","review_id":"N7nnkJeDrtrrY9bt__DEQg","date":"2020-12-22T20:48:40","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9516373872756958,"text_excerpt":"I had a fantastic meal from this little shop on Freret Street! They had friendly staff and COVID-safety in mind (number of customers inside was limited and masks required). I ordered 4 tacos and a kolache, partially using the $10 Yelp Elite Perk store credit that I was provided. I tried the strawberry-cheese kolache, which was amazing! It had crunchy sugary crumbs with a strawberry-cheesecake-like filling. The pastry dough was incredibly soft and delicious. Fairly priced at $2-3, they apparently flew off the shelves because it was the only one left when I arrived around noon. I regret not getting there earlier! I also had pork, chicken, fish, and shrimp tacos. They used double layers of s..."},{"business_id":"Zt7SfTU6N9SKDvVvpNpoGg","review_id":"Vnh-iYdlsvRmAq4HmJe9Aw","date":"2019-10-25T21:07:44","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9465229511260986,"text_excerpt":"Great place to grab a quick breakfast/snack! It's nice that they have a few parking spots in the back, as Freret street can be difficult to find parking on at certain hours. They have a variety of sweet and savory kolaches, breakfast tacos, lunch tacos, and empanadas to choose from. I got the spicy sausage & cheese kolache ($2.10) and boudin, jalapeno, cheese kolache ($3.25). The boudin one was amazing -- the filling was not too salty as boudin sometimes can be. Not very filling so if you're doing this as a meal, I'd recommend 2-3 kolaches, or a kolache + tacos! The spicy sausage & cheese kolache was a little smaller and had a lot of air in it and not enough meat/cheese in my opinion, but..."},{"business_id":"Zt7SfTU6N9SKDvVvpNpoGg","review_id":"IjBqG2ydY_Zi7RPP9ViMaA","date":"2019-10-23T13:42:25","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9412068128585815,"text_excerpt":"This place is great! I had the bacon and cheese Kolache and it was delicious! My friend had the swift tacos and the were great too. Service was friendly and fast!"}],"visual":[{"business_id":"Zt7SfTU6N9SKDvVvpNpoGg","photo_id":"lGDwps0UrLZjZXPzEIBuYA","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/lGDwps0UrLZjZXPzEIBuYA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8976778984069824},{"business_id":"Zt7SfTU6N9SKDvVvpNpoGg","photo_id":"WljWKHvXEUpD0P2t7UXm4g","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/WljWKHvXEUpD0P2t7UXm4g.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8715552091598511},{"business_id":"Zt7SfTU6N9SKDvVvpNpoGg","photo_id":"waCjT5n-ehEUzup5l7UY1g","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/waCjT5n-ehEUzup5l7UY1g.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8345637321472168},{"business_id":"Zt7SfTU6N9SKDvVvpNpoGg","photo_id":"Z0o844OlAuOiIG6u7uyi5w","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/Z0o844OlAuOiIG6u7uyi5w.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8096256256103516},{"business_id":"Zt7SfTU6N9SKDvVvpNpoGg","photo_id":"eQNeA4NHRIaEaPvDgW2Q6w","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/eQNeA4NHRIaEaPvDgW2Q6w.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7671056985855103}]},"notebook_case":null}
